DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
18285::$$$message_0140_0000_0000$$$::...That's right.[lr]::
18286::$$$message_0140_0000_0001$$$::Leys mentioned that this castle has a central courtyard.[lr]::
18287::$$$message_0140_0000_0002$$$::I'm afraid to go in without asking since Sella manages it, but it shouldn't be a problem if Illya's with me.::
18288::$$$message_0140_0001_0000$$$::"The courtyard? Sure, we have one, but there's really nothing to see there. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ11a(中)]If you want to play, I think the third floor that Rin trashed would be more interesting."[lr]::
18289::$$$message_0140_0001_0001$$$::"More like dangerous. No thanks. I just want to relax with you today, so let's go somewhere we can take a walk."::
18290::$$$message_0140_0002_0000$$$::"Really? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ11a(中)]...Hm, then I'll give you special permission to enter the garden. Are you going to be all right dressed like that? The courtyard is the coldest part of the castle, so you might want to put on a coat."::
18291::$$$message_0140_0003_0000$$$::"You're right. Can I borrow a scarf?"[lr]::
18292::$$$message_0140_0003_0001$$$::"Yeah! I'll get you one I've been saving just in case. Plus one of the coats, too."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
18293::$$$message_0140_0004_0000$$$::"I know I said it already, but the courtyard really isn't that impressive. The Einzberns live in wintry mountains, so we don't have a custom of growing flowers in the garden."::
18294::$$$message_0140_0005_0000$$$::Sella must have guessed Illya's thoughts and planted the flowerbed, then.[lr]::
18295::$$$message_0140_0005_0001$$$::She seems strict to Illya, but I bet she's soft on her at heart.::
18296::$$$message_0140_0006_0000$$$::"I'm opening the door... Again, don't be disappointed, okay, Shirou?"::
18297::$$$message_0140_0007_0000$$$::The door opens.[lr]::
18298::$$$message_0140_0007_0001$$$::Cold air, colder than any autumn, stings my cheeks.[lr]::
18299::$$$message_0140_0007_0002$$$::The sky above the castle is shrouded in gray.[lr]::
18300::$$$message_0140_0007_0003$$$::The garden comes into view, lit by an eternally winter sunshine.::
18301::$$$message_0140_0008_0000$$$::My breath mists white.[lr]::
18302::$$$message_0140_0008_0001$$$::This really is a world where it's always winter.[lr]::
18303::$$$message_0140_0008_0002$$$::The courtyard is dead silent.[lr]::
18304::$$$message_0140_0008_0003$$$::This must be the center of the concave-shaped castle compound.::
18305::$$$message_0140_0009_0000$$$::"I bet you're disappointed. Sella did her best, but this is all she could manage. It's too cold for any more flowers to grow."[lr]::
18306::$$$message_0140_0009_0001$$$::Illya sounds dispirited.[lr]::
18307::$$$message_0140_0009_0002$$$::From an ordinary guy's point of view, though, I'm amazed. This garden would look right at home in a public park.::
18308::$$$message_0140_0010_0000$$$::"I'm not disappointed at all. You're taking great care of the garden even though it's this big, and the flowers are so bright and colorful. Seeing flowers bloom in all this cold feels like such a luxury."::
18309::$$$message_0140_0011_0000$$$::"Y-you think so? I think it lacks elegance. We have to decorate it more. [cacheimage storage=イリヤコート08h(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=イリヤコート08h(遠)]Like turning the entire floor into a fountain, adding a canopy and covering it in green, and such... I think it needs something to astonish people who see it."::
18310::$$$message_0140_0012_0000$$$::"You do like to go all-out. I find gardens that are as natural as possible to be more relaxing. There's no greenhouse, either. Maybe that's more to Sella's taste?"::
18311::$$$message_0140_0013_0000$$$::"Y-yeah. She said we should keep it like this most of the time, and only decorate on special days.[lr]::
18312::$$$message_0140_0013_0001$$$::Sella's nice to plants and animals, actually. She talks about how life is happiest when it's in its original element."::
18313::$$$message_0140_0014_0000$$$::"...I see. That's pretty insightful. So none of the flowers here have been modified?"::
18314::$$$message_0140_0015_0000$$$::"I think so. It was more barren the last time I came here.[lr]::
18315::$$$message_0140_0015_0001$$$::Sella and Leys told me that they prepared the soil, replanted the flowers that were still blooming, and shored up the bare earth with stone slabs."::
18316::$$$message_0140_0016_0000$$$::She describes it as if it happened a long time ago.[lr]::
18317::$$$message_0140_0016_0001$$$::But...if the plants were here before Illya came to Fuyuki, this garden might have been in full bloom ten years ago.::
18318::$$$message_0140_0017_0000$$$::"Oh. Maybe this place will be in full bloom someday."[lr]::
18319::$$$message_0140_0017_0001$$$::"Yeah. If that happens, then I can forgive it not being elegant. Sella said that she wanted to take her time cultivating it. I'm looking forward to seeing what it looks like in two years."[lr]::
18320::$$$message_0140_0017_0002$$$::The garden might fill the whole courtyard.[lr]::
18321::$$$message_0140_0017_0003$$$::Speaking for myself, that might make this the most extravagant spot in the whole castle.::
18322::$$$message_0140_0018_0000$$$::We aimlessly stroll through the courtyard together.[lr]::
18323::$$$message_0140_0018_0001$$$::Illya's running around, twice as excited as she was earlier.::
18324::$$$message_0140_0019_0000$$$::"Look, Shirou! There's a little bird on that branch![lr]::
18325::$$$message_0140_0019_0001$$$::I hope it builds a nest!"::
18326::$$$message_0140_0020_0000$$$::"Oh, there's something written on this pedestal.[cacheimage storage=イリヤコート06d(中),イリヤコート10c(中)][wvl][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=235 top=122 time=300 accel=0 storage=イリヤコート06d(中)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=223 top=174 time=300 accel=0 storage=イリヤコート10c(中)] Let's see... 'This flowerbed was planted on this day. May they grow up bright and strong...' [cacheimage storage=イリヤコート10c(中)][wvl][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=223 top=174 time=300 accel=0 storage=イリヤコート10c(中)][move textoff=0 time=150 path=(174,187,155)(196,174,255)(220,188,255)(234,175,255) storage=イリヤコート04a頬(中) accel=0 spline=1]Wow, Sella actually made a commemorative plaque, like something out of a girls' comic book. That [font italic=true]so[font italic=false] doesn't fit her."::
18327::$$$message_0140_0021_0000$$$::"Ah, stop, stop! Shirou, don't walk over there! There's a pitfall trap there to catch burglars. It'll send you straight into the dungeons!"::
18328::$$$message_0140_0022_0000$$$::Just watching her frolic lifts my spirits, too.[lr]::
18329::$$$message_0140_0022_0001$$$::I'm in the mood to even take a walk in the forest.::
18330::$$$message_0140_0023_0000$$$::"Shirou, Shirou![lr]::
18331::$$$message_0140_0023_0001$$$::Do you know what the bud on that branch is?"[lr]::
18332::$$$message_0140_0023_0002$$$::"Huh? Um...it's some kind of bud, right? Not a walnut, I'm pretty sure."[lr]::
18333::$$$message_0140_0023_0003$$$::"Heh heh! Too bad, it is a walnut! It's called a sawagurumi[line len=2]a Japanese wingnut[line len=2]and it's actually related to walnuts even if it looks different!"::
18334::$$$message_0140_0024_0000$$$::"Oh, really? You sure know a lot, Illya."[lr]::
18335::$$$message_0140_0024_0001$$$::"Yeah, I know all about walnuts. Kiritsugu cheated a lot, so I picked up all his walnut facts."[lr]::
18336::$$$message_0140_0024_0002$$$::"Huh...? Kiri...tsugu?"::
18337::$$$message_0140_0025_0000$$$::"Yeah, that Kiritsugu.[lr]::
18338::$$$message_0140_0025_0001$$$::...It must bother you that I suddenly brought him up. I did come here to kill you because you're his son."::
18339::$$$message_0140_0026_0000$$$::Illya looks lost in thought.[lr]::
18340::$$$message_0140_0026_0001$$$::...That was my mistake.[lr]::
18341::$$$message_0140_0026_0002$$$::She was just making conversation, but I got self-conscious and made it awkward.::
18342::$$$message_0140_0027_0000$$$::"...Sorry I left you hanging. You already told me that it doesn't bother you anymore."[lr]::
18343::$$$message_0140_0027_0001$$$::"Ahaha, you don't have to apologize. I was being insensitive. I think we both made it awkward."::
18344::$$$message_0140_0028_0000$$$::"Besides, apologizing won't change anything now...[cacheimage storage=イリヤコート02b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤコート02b(中)] It's too soon to relax, Big Brother. I still think about it."[lr]::
18345::$$$message_0140_0028_0001$$$::"Gah."[lr]::
18346::$$$message_0140_0028_0002$$$::The little imp is back.[lr]::
18347::$$$message_0140_0028_0003$$$::She is alive and well, but driven more by affection, not hatred. And it's my job as her big brother to accept it all.::
18348::$$$message_0140_0029_0000$$$::"Got it. I'll always keep that in mind. I'll train myself as best I can to not die, so bring it on [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-2]anytime."[lr]::
18349::$$$message_0140_0029_0001$$$::"Okay. I'll make a move if I ever want you to spoil me. No takebacks when the time comes."[lr]::
18350::$$$message_0140_0029_0002$$$::She returns my grin with a bubbly smile.[lr]::
18351::$$$message_0140_0029_0003$$$::...Damn. I'll seriously have to double my training...::
18352::$$$message_0140_0030_0000$$$::"Ahh... So Illya, about earlier, you mentioned Kiritsugu was cheating.[lr]::
18353::$$$message_0140_0030_0001$$$::What'd he do?"::
18354::$$$message_0140_0031_0000$$$::"He was a cheater, that's what. We were seeing who could find more winter walnut buds, but Kiritsugu kept counting all these other walnuts I didn't know, like sawagurumi or nogurumi.[lr]::
18355::$$$message_0140_0031_0001$$$::I only knew regular walnuts, so how was I supposed to beat Kiritsugu when he knew all the different walnuts?[lr]::
18356::$$$message_0140_0031_0002$$$::And he never told me all these other nuts existed until I noticed he was cheating."::
18357::$$$message_0140_0032_0000$$$::"Aha. You only knew what red walnuts looked like and hunted for those, but he collected the green and yellow nuts, too.[lr]::
18358::$$$message_0140_0032_0001$$$::It was three on one; you didn't stand a chance. My old man sure pulled a childish stunt."::
18359::$$$message_0140_0033_0000$$$::"Right? Mother knew and didn't tell me, either. She just said that she was jealous of how close we were.[lr]::
18360::$$$message_0140_0033_0001$$$::Mother was even closer to Kiritsugu than me. She knew him before I did."::
18361::$$$message_0140_0034_0000$$$::Illya huffs and pouts.[lr]::
18362::$$$message_0140_0034_0001$$$::It's very adorable.[lr]::
18363::$$$message_0140_0034_0002$$$::"...Hold on. You said your mom and Kiritsugu were together...?"[lr]::
18364::$$$message_0140_0034_0003$$$::Saber told me that Kiritsugu was by himself.[lr]::
18365::$$$message_0140_0034_0004$$$::According to her, he left his wife and daughter in Germany and came to fight in the war alone.::
18366::$$$message_0140_0035_0000$$$::"Oh, that. See how dishonest he was?[lr]::
18367::$$$message_0140_0035_0001$$$::It's true that in the last Holy Grail War, Kiritsugu fought on his own without taking Saber along.[lr]::
18368::$$$message_0140_0035_0002$$$::But that was a lie.[lr]::
18369::$$$message_0140_0035_0003$$$::Kiritsugu brought Mother to Japan with him and had her act as Saber's Master, despite not ever having a real conversation with Saber."::
18370::$$$message_0140_0036_0000$$$::"But Mother died because of that.[lr]::
18371::$$$message_0140_0036_0001$$$::Kiritsugu intended to fight and win alone.[lr]::
18372::$$$message_0140_0036_0002$$$::But it couldn't have gone that well, right?[lr]::
18373::$$$message_0140_0036_0003$$$::He couldn't betray who he was.[lr]::
18374::$$$message_0140_0036_0004$$$::He left Irisviel, my mother[line len=2]no, he left all of us who are Justeaze behind and chose to survive alone."::
18375::$$$message_0140_0037_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
18376::$$$message_0140_0037_0001$$$::My knowledge of the events Illya's describing from ten years ago is so fragmented that I can't really make sense of them.[lr]::
18377::$$$message_0140_0037_0002$$$::All I understand is...[lr]::
18378::$$$message_0140_0037_0003$$$::"...Then, when he came to Japan, you were alone?"[lr]::
18379::$$$message_0140_0037_0004$$$::...that Illya's mother died here in Fuyuki.::
18380::$$$message_0140_0038_0000$$$::"I wasn't alone. Mother always stayed with me even when Kiritsugu headed out.[lr]::
18381::$$$message_0140_0038_0001$$$::But the woman who died in the fourth war was still the woman who gave birth to me."[lr]::
18382::$$$message_0140_0038_0002$$$::"...?"::
18383::$$$message_0140_0039_0000$$$::"I think Saber was the one all alone, not me.[lr]::
18384::$$$message_0140_0039_0001$$$::I said this earlier, but Kiritsugu and Saber never understood each other."[lr]::
18385::$$$message_0140_0039_0002$$$::...I've heard that from Saber, too.[lr]::
18386::$$$message_0140_0039_0003$$$::She said that Kiritsugu never really spoke to her and that he used his Command Spells to force her to destroy the Holy Grail without ever revealing the Grail's true nature.::
18387::$$$message_0140_0040_0000$$$::"...I see. So Saber and Kiritsugu moved separately?"::
18388::$$$message_0140_0041_0000$$$::"Wouldn't you think so?[lr]::
18389::$$$message_0140_0041_0001$$$::There were probably times when they were together, but I think they mostly split up.[lr]::
18390::$$$message_0140_0041_0002$$$::Saber confided that to me when she found out I'm Irisviel's daughter.[lr]::
18391::$$$message_0140_0041_0003$$$::Oh, Saber. I think she assumed at first that I was one of the generic Einzbern homunculi, not Kiritsugu's daughter. So rude."::
18392::$$$message_0140_0042_0000$$$::I learn something new about the war ten years ago.[lr]::
18393::$$$message_0140_0042_0001$$$::Saber is very reluctant to talk about what happened back then.[lr]::
18394::$$$message_0140_0042_0002$$$::It's all in the past.[lr]::
18395::$$$message_0140_0042_0003$$$::She says that now that the relevant parties are gone, I shouldn't dig into it.::
18396::$$$message_0140_0043_0000$$$::...But some of us who were hurt are still here.[lr]::
18397::$$$message_0140_0043_0001$$$::A survivor of the war ten years ago, and a girl who was left behind.[lr]::
18398::$$$message_0140_0043_0002$$$::Both of us have the same father, and we're still circling his karmic spiral.::
18399::$$$message_0140_0044_0000$$$::"Come on, Shirou, don't look at me like that. We can't forget what happened a long time ago, but we can't let it hold us back, either.[lr]::
18400::$$$message_0140_0044_0001$$$::We're our own people. We should live the way we want."[lr]::
18401::$$$message_0140_0044_0002$$$::...Her smile is genuine.[lr]::
18402::$$$message_0140_0044_0003$$$::Illya looks straight ahead, as if encouraging me.[clfg textoff=0 time=100 storage=イリヤコート01b(中)]::
18403::$$$message_0140_0045_0000$$$::"Thanks, Illya. I'm really happy to hear you say that... [l][say storage=makyo07_shi_0191 name=士郎]But it doesn't quite make sense. You said just earlier that you aren't over it."::
18404::$$$message_0140_0046_0000$$$::"That's separate. The statute of limitations might've run out for Kiritsugu, but you're still Shirou.[lr]::
18405::$$$message_0140_0046_0001$$$::What I'm saying is, I'm going to keep chasing you around...[cacheimage storage=イリヤコート02b(中)][wvl][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 time=300 pos=c accel=0 storage=イリヤコート02b(中)][move textoff=0 time=150 path=(151,1,155)(151,15,255)(151,4,255) storage=イリヤコート03b(中) accel=0] I've already made it my life's work!"::
18406::$$$message_0140_0047_0000$$$::She skips in front of me, laughing, "good for you!"[lr]::
18407::$$$message_0140_0047_0001$$$::Urgh. Is this what they call excessive sibling affection?::
18408::$$$message_0140_0048_0000$$$::"My mind's made up, so enough of this boring topic. We should spend our time together having fun."[lr]::
18409::$$$message_0140_0048_0001$$$::Illya pulls my arm.[lr]::
18410::$$$message_0140_0048_0002$$$::I completely agree with her.::
18411::$$$message_0140_0049_0000$$$::"Sure, let's play until the sun goes down. Why don't we go all the way to the forest?"[lr]::
18412::$$$message_0140_0049_0001$$$::"Yeah, let's do that! [cacheimage storage=イリヤコート04b頬(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 pos=c storage=イリヤコート04b頬(近)]I'll teach you all the different kinds of walnuts there are.[lr]::
18413::$$$message_0140_0049_0002$$$::This forest still belongs to the Einzberns, even if it's a long way from home. I'm sure we'll find too many walnuts to count!"::
18414::$$$message_0140_0050_0000$$$::Illya takes my hand, and we leave the garden.[lr]::
18415::$$$message_0140_0050_0001$$$::It's her first walnut hunt in ten years.[lr]::
18416::$$$message_0140_0050_0002$$$::Long ago, a man and his young daughter forged a bond.[lr]::
18417::$$$message_0140_0050_0003$$$::He's passed that baton down to me.::

